WEBVTT

00:00:29.413 --> 00:00:31.621
With imagination, we can
anticipate the future.

00:00:34.662 --> 00:00:36.121
We can revisit the past.

00:00:38.746 --> 00:00:40.871
You can step outside the present moment

00:00:40.871 --> 00:00:43.079
and try and see things 
as other people see them.

00:00:45.496 --> 00:00:48.204
It’s through creativity that we develop
our architecture,

00:00:49.537 --> 00:00:50.912
our scientific proofs,

00:00:52.371 --> 00:00:53.704
and our works of art.

00:00:54.621 --> 00:00:56.746
We don’t just
live in the world as we find it,

00:00:56.746 --> 00:01:01.371
we create civilizations, theories,
technologies,